{"about":"Destiny 2's iridescence lookup (the texture a dye's iridescence id picks a row of: x = N.V, row = the id), as each row's mean linear color over N.V 0.25-1. From 'Iridescence Lookup.png' in TiredHobgoblin's Destiny-Collada-Generator (Resources/), taken from the game. A dye with an odd id tints its reflections this color, an even id replaces its color, both by 1 - the dye color's luminance (the Collada generator's template.shader). Destiny 2 and its content are Bungie's. film: per row, the Helldivers 2 thin-film step (0-7) whose colors over N.V come closest to the row's hue, and how far off it is (the sum of squared differences of the unit color vectors at 16 N.V values; under ~1.5 a fair match).","source":"https://github.com/TiredHobgoblin/Destiny-Collada-Generator/blob/HEAD/Resources/Iridescence%20Lookup.png","rows":[[0.556,0.5586,0.5086],[0.0565,0.0568,0.052],[0.3433,0.5466,0.7247],[0.0365,0.0558,0.0721],[0.6368,0.6046,0.6761],[0.0637,0.0609,0.0672],[0.6755,0.6177,0.9442],[0.0675,0.0623,0.0915],[0.7544,0.6502,0.532],[0.0738,0.0644,0.0538],[0.5665,0.4148,0.5516],[0.0572,0.0434,0.0558],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.2611,0.2017,0.3119],[0.0375,0.0317,0.042],[0.1449,0.231,0.3788],[0.0179,0.0264,0.04],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.5625,0.0,0.5625],[0.6282,0.3935,0.4072],[0.0631,0.0419,0.0429],[0.3857,0.5865,0.5289],[0.0407,0.0591,0.0541],[0.3279,0.6978,0.9609],[0.0355,0.0695,0.0921],[0.3367,0.936,0.8721],[0.0362,0.0904,0.0842],[0.9536,0.9367,0.5077],[0.0917,0.0903,0.0521],[0.3333,0.9459,0.2695],[0.0365,0.0906,0.0302],[0.5963,0.3997,0.7899],[0.0595,0.0424,0.0768],[0.4755,0.9994,0.3199],[0.049,0.0953,0.0346],[0.4897,0.4299,0.9861],[0.0507,0.0452,0.0941],[0.488,0.4312,0.9473],[0.0498,0.0453,0.091],[0.3115,0.8412,0.7886],[